    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82841" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφάνη ἢ πεφύκασι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφήσομαι</span></b> , fut.
		
			Pass.
		 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνω</span> and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θείνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφῐδέσθαι</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφῐδοίμην</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφῐδήσομαι</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φείδομαι</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφλάζει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράζει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφλοιδώς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φλοιὸν ἀποβαλών</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφλοιδέναι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλυκταινοῦσθαι</span>, Id.</div>
